Before I show you what advantages dependency&nbsp;
injection brings, let's see a scenario where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:43.520
there is no dependency injection. In a typical&nbsp;
application, let's see we have three pages right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:51.280
now. And we have some common functionality that we&nbsp;
want to use across all the three pages. Like let's&nbsp;&nbsp;

